{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1411304-scion-titanomachy-pdf","id":1411304,"title":"Scion Titanomachy PDF","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-01T00:51:10-07:00","id":1411304,"title":"Scion Titanomachy PDF","content":"By <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/demi-ready-for-demigod-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Monday Meeting Notes</b></a>, tomorrow <b>Scion Titanomachy</b> will hit DriveThru as Advanced PDF ( late beta, before fan pointed errata phase ). It is 'chroncile/antagonists' book (?), probably. As I'm very excited on this book( beside <b>Demigod</b> ), and look very much to read it, I thought 'reviews/reading topic' was in order.<br /> <br /> So how is your Second Titanomachy in the World of <b>Scion</b>? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Here is product sum-up:<br /> <b>'Scion: Titanomachy</b> has everything a Storyguide needs to bring the Second Titanomachy \u2014 a phase in the eternal cold war against the Gods \u2014 to their <b>Scion Second Edition</b> games. It presents new threats from the Titans to their servants, plus their fell powers and Birthrights \u2014 ripe for use as antagonists or as new material for players\u2019 characters. It also provides adventure hooks to springboard Storyguides into the action.<br /> <b>Scion: Origin </b>and <b>Scion: Hero</b> are required to use this book.<br /> This book includes:<ul><li>Titans for each of the core pantheons, to be used as enemies or strange allies.</li> <li>Three adventure hooks to help Storyguides run epic games involving the Second Titanomachy.</li> <li>Dozens of all-new antagonists from enemy Scions to fearsome monsters.</li> <li>New, Titan-themed Birthrights and Knacks for players to discover and use.'</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-01T01:18:47-07:00","id":1411307,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m definitely excited for the new Callings, especially Primeval, like I\u2019ve always been a big fan for embodiments of forces characters, I also know plenty of people who can\u2019t wait for Destroyer since those fit a good number of gods as well","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24769-magicjohnny","name":"Magicjohnny","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24769_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-01T06:20:14-07:00","id":1411335,"title":"","content":"It doesn't mention new Callings. They might be holding onto them until God drops.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-01T06:24:06-07:00","id":1411336,"title":"","content":"I mean on the Discord server, the devs have mentioned at times the Titan Callings being in Titanomachy, there\u2019s nothing indicating that they aren\u2019t there, like I don\u2019t recall anything about new Knacks except for sample Knacks for the Titan Callings on the server so it seems like a safe assumption in my opinion","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24769,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24769-magicjohnny","user":"Magicjohnny","date":". 09-01-2020, 09:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24769-magicjohnny","name":"Magicjohnny","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24769_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-01T10:34:15-07:00","id":1411374,"title":"","content":"I figure the Callings will be part of the &quot;Write ups for Titans&quot; and &quot;New Knacks&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-01T10:55:48-07:00","id":1411385,"title":"","content":"Sounds very cool. I'm eagerly looking forward to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequen