:3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-02T11:31:19-07:00","id":1411530,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1411304-scion-titanomachy-pdf?p=1411528#post1411528\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/326635/Titanomachy?affiliate_id=498510\" target=\"_blank\">It is here! </a></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks Second Chances <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I love that we can always count on you for things like this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10272-daigotsu-max","name":"Daigotsu Max","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-02T12:06:37-07:00","id":1411533,"title":"","content":"The degree to which I am deeply and fundamentally disappointed in this cannot be overstated.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Scion 2e Homebrew Projects:<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BUnAIZEDk4Zs_W0ELfffeFRAiSel3nAl/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The \u0160iune\u0161</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MMw0vBmHdvuGUbVhyFw7BpXT49UgECnR/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Enduri</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CZuVp5VuftwuwHtzrWADqIaq7Vl-LMIr/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Sg\u0101\u2019na Qeda\u2019s</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/17piJ8ZBzvt4PL47vz5Gw3BF6HOZelrfh/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Abosom</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/282712/Lebor-Oe-In-Dea?src=newest_community\" target=\"_blank\">Lebor \u00d3e In Dea</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rk9BKLqbUEroFDvuPSQOwp-pBRxSvN9P/view\" target=\"_blank\">The Zemi</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/324026/Nemetondevos-Revised\" target=\"_blank\">Nemetondevos: Revised</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/325461/Mysteries-of-the-Otherworld\" target=\"_blank\">Mysteries of the Otherworld</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/394-watcher","name":"Watcher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"662"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-02T12:20:08-07:00","id":1411534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Watcher</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1411304-scion-titanomachy-pdf?p=1411533#post1411533\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The degree to which I am deeply and fundamentally disappointed in this cannot be overstated.</div> </div> </div> </div>In what way? I won't be able to read through mine for a few hours?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">&quot;We have done the impossible, and that makes us mighty.&quot;<br /> Captain Malcolm Reynolds</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/679-unnatural1","name":"unnatural1","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-02T13:00:36-07:00","id":1411540,"title":"","content":"I'm digging it a lot. Collateral damage rules. A ton of new antagonists stats. A bunch of new organizations. A lot of new lore (Rasputin tricked a god or titan into making him a scion), rules for creating and playing a scion of a titan. 3 adventures. lots of new birthrights.<br /> <br /> The only downside I see so far is they only write up 3 to 5 titans per pantheon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12488-jeremysbrain","name":"Jeremysbrain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-02T13:08:12-07:00","id":1411541,"title":"","content":"What I think is bothering is not the reduced number of Titans per pantheon, but the fact that some Titans should not be there.<br /> <br /> I like the book in general, as I didn\u2019t read, and it adds lot of material to a campaign, but sure some people will be disappointed on the Titans, as some of them should not be there for different reasons (read the TDD Titans for example).<br /> <br /> I may leave another comment in the future once I read more, but so far I like almost everything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-02T13:15:19-07:00","id":1411543,"title":"","content":"Two things I noticed about the Titan writeups: Firstly, all of the Titans have multiple Purviews \u2014 the idea that Titans are dominated by a single purview seems to be gone completely. Secondly, Titanic Virtues are barely mentioned at all \u2014 have Virtues listed, and there\u2019s no discussion of what Virtues Titan Scions use. These seem like pretty significant conceptual changes, since the core books seemed to treat Purviews and Virtues as the primary difference between Scions and Gods.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/40-dspaul","name":"DSPaul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-02T13:25:18-07:00","id":1411544,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DSPaul</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1411304-scion-titanomachy-pdf?p=1411543#post1411543\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Two things I noticed about the Titan writeups: Firstly, all of the Titans have multiple Purviews \u2014 the idea that Titans are dominated by a single purview seems to be gone completely. Secondly, Titanic Virtues are barely mentioned at all \u2014 have Virtues listed, and there\u2019s no discussion of what Virtues Titan Scions use. These seem like pretty significant conceptual changes, since the core books seemed to treat Purviews and Virtues as the primary difference between Scions and Gods.</div> </div> </div> </div>Titanic Scion Character Creation is being covered elsewhere, if I recall correctly, which should address your concerns about Titanic Virtues and how their Scions use them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.erykahfassett.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman, serif\"><b>Erykah Fassett</b></span></a><br /> <i><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&quot;The closer you get to the light, the greater your shadow becomes.&quot;</span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24398-shadowblossoms","name":"ShadowBlossoms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24398_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-02T13:34:54-07:00","id":1411546,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowBlossoms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1411304-scion-titanomachy-pdf?p=1411544#post1411544\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Titanic Scion Character Creation is being covered elsewhere, if I recall correctly, which should address your concerns about Titanic Virtues and how their Scions use them.</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s rather odd, considering that the Titanic Callings and Knacks are printed in Titanomachy. And given the otherwise-detailed writeups for the sample Titans, it\u2019s really odd that their virtues aren\u2019t listed \u2014 especially since there\u2019s a sidebar in the Storyguide chapter talking about how you should always keep a Titan\u2019s Virtues and Purview in mind when portraying them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/40-dspaul","name":"DSPaul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date"